       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINOFORM-QUAD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KINOFORM-QUAD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GS-RANDOM-MASK-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FOURIER-SIGNAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ODD-HARMONIC-SNR-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KINOFORM-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KINOFORM-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KINOFORM-QUAD-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PKO-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PKO-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MASK-AND-SIGNAL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SNR-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKO-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MASK-AND-SIGNAL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GS-RANDOM-MASK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FOURIER-SIGNAL-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SNR-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ODD-HARMONIC-SNR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KINOFORM-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKO-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GS-RANDOM-MASK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FOURIER-SIGNAL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ODD-HARMONIC-SNR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KINOFORM-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-KINOFORM-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PKO-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PKO-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PKO-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PKO-CODE.
